---
/** @type {{ facts: {value: string, label: string}[] }} */
const { facts } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mt-6">
  <p class="text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-muted">
    The problem
  </p>

  <dl class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
    {facts.map((f) => (
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-surface-2 px-3 py-3 text-center">
        <dd class="text-[1.375rem] font-semibold tabular-nums tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[1.5rem]">
          {f.value}
        </dd>
        <dt class="mt-0.5 text-[0.6875rem] leading-tight text-muted">{f.label}</dt>
      </div>
    ))}
  </dl>

  <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">
    Objective functions are minimised, so zero means solved. A seed makes any run
    reproducible bit for bit.
  </p>
</div>
